        "text": "Page: Orgasmic platform. Sentence: The orgasmic platform is the tissues of the outer third of the vagina, labeled by Masters and Johnson.\nPage: Masters and Johnson. Sentence: The Masters and Johnson research team, composed of William H. Masters and Virginia E. Johnson, pioneered research into the nature of human sexual response and the diagnosis and treatment of sexual disorders and dysfunctions from 1957 until the 1990s.\nPage: Sensate focusing. Sentence: The term was introduced by Masters and Johnson, and was aimed at increasing personal and interpersonal awareness of self and the other's needs.",
